# These large binaries are served to the site via the beforeFiles rewrites in
# next.config.mjs, which proxy /UniversalFrameFX.exe and
# /UniversalFrameFX-portable.zip to raw.githubusercontent.com (the main branch).
# They therefore never need to ship inside the Vercel build, so we keep them out
# to trim every production deployment. They stay committed under public/ so the
# raw URLs continue to resolve.
public/UniversalFrameFX.exe
public/UniversalFrameFX-portable.zip
